Export `tabsReducer(state, action)` that manages editor tabs. State: `{ open: string[], active: string }`. Actions:
`{type:'OPEN_TAB', id}` → append id to `open` (unless already there) and make it `active`;
`{type:'SELECT_TAB', id}` → set active ONLY if the id is in `open`, else unchanged;
`{type:'CLOSE_TAB', id}` → remove it from `open`; if it was active, the new active is the LAST remaining tab (or `''` if none). Unknown → unchanged. No mutation.

